Provenance of the vendored RenderDoc in-application API header (runtime/third_party/renderdoc)

renderdoc_app.h is the header of RenderDoc 1.45 (https://github.com/baldurk/renderdoc,
renderdoc/api/app/renderdoc_app.h), unchanged (SHA-256
b7005e7dc34c3635046868bbd76d81b9b055aede0f56daa0bd39fedee0639ffb). The layer includes it for the
types of RENDERDOC_GetAPI and the frame capture calls; nothing of RenderDoc is linked or loaded
unless the program runs under it (core/capture.c finds RENDERDOC_GetAPI in the already loaded
library). RenderDoc is offered under the MIT license, whose text is in LICENSE beside this file.
